@startuml
[*] --> DRAFT
DRAFT --> SUBMITTED : submit
SUBMITTED --> APPROVED : final approval
SUBMITTED --> REJECTED : reject
REJECTED --> DRAFT : edit
APPROVED --> DRAFT : revise before posting / invalidate approval
APPROVED --> PARTIAL : post partial
APPROVED --> COMPLETED : post all
PARTIAL --> PARTIAL : post next
PARTIAL --> COMPLETED : finish or authorized close remainder
DRAFT --> CANCELLED : cancel
SUBMITTED --> CANCELLED : cancel
APPROVED --> CANCELLED : cancel before posting
note right of COMPLETED
Reversal is a new document.
Posted ledger is never edited.
end note
REJECTED --> CANCELLED : cancel before posting
@enduml
